<title>USA: COREStaff completes Telos unit acquisition.</title>
<headline>COREStaff completes Telos unit acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>COREStaff Inc said it completed the acquisition of Telos Corp's Telos Consulting Services unit for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>COREStaff said the acquisition would give its information technology services group 1996 revenues of about $340 million. It did not say what the group's revenues are currently or what the acquisition's contribution would be.</p>
<p>It did not provide further details.</p>
<p>Officials from COREStaff were not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
